+]:
+    """
+    Load block mask(s) from a JSON file.
+
+    Returns:
+        - None if path is None/empty or file has no mask data.
+        - If top-level key "masks" (list): list of (mask_tensor, BATCH, num_q_blocks, num_kv_blocks).
